{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive YouTube Shorts video gallery section optimized for vertical 9:16 aspect ratio thumbnails with lazy loading and interactive play controls.
    
    Core Features:
    - YouTube Shorts video cards with 9:16 portrait aspect ratio (optimized for Shorts thumbnails)
    - Lazy loading: videos load only when play button is clicked
    - Interactive play/pause toggle: clicking shows pause icon, clicking again resumes playback
    - Thumbnail displays until user initiates playback
    - Embedded YouTube player with custom controls
    
    Layout & Alignment:
    - Flexible grid system with adjustable columns (1-6 cards per row on desktop)
    - Responsive breakpoints: desktop multi-column, tablet 2-column, mobile single-column stacked
    - Alignment controls: left, center, or right alignment for entire section
    - Adjustable gap/spacing between cards (horizontal and vertical)
    - Content max-width control with centering option
    
    Card Structure (all elements optional):
    - Video thumbnail image (9:16 ratio for YouTube Shorts)
    - Play/pause button icon overlay (centered, toggles on click)
    - Label text (appears above thumbnail, optional)
    - Title text (appears below thumbnail, optional)
    - Description text (appears below title, optional)
    - YouTube video URL/ID input
    
    Settings Schema:
    Section-level:
    - Section heading (optional, customizable text, size, weight, color, alignment)
    - Section description (optional, customizable text, size, color)
    - Background color and padding controls
    - Content max-width slider
    - Grid columns: 1-6 columns on desktop
    - Card gap controls: horizontal spacing, vertical spacing (in pixels or rem)
    - Section alignment: left, center, right
    - Mobile column override (1 or 2 columns)
    
    Video Card Blocks (repeatable):
    - YouTube video URL or video ID
    - Thumbnail image upload (9:16 aspect ratio recommended)
    - Enable/disable label (toggle)
    - Label text, font size, weight, color, position (above or overlay)
    - Enable/disable title (toggle)
    - Title text, font size, weight, color, line height
    - Enable/disable description (toggle)
    - Description text, font size, color
    - Card border radius control
    - Thumbnail overlay color and opacity
    - Hover effects: zoom scale, brightness adjustment
    
    Play/Pause Button:
    - Play icon (SVG or upload custom)
    - Pause icon (SVG or upload custom)
    - Button size control (small, medium, large, or custom pixel size)
    - Button background: circle or square with adjustable color and opacity
    - Icon color control
    - Hover effects: scale, color change, background opacity
    - Position: center (default) or custom positioning
    
    Video Behavior:
    - Lazy loading: video iframe loads only on first play button click
    - Click to play: replaces thumbnail with embedded YouTube player
    - Click to pause: pauses video and shows pause icon
    - Autoplay on click (no sound until user interaction)
    - Option to open in lightbox/modal instead of inline playback
    - Option to link to YouTube instead of embedding
    
    CTA Section (optional):
    - CTA button text and URL
    - Button style: filled or outline
    - Button colors: background, text, border
    - Border radius control
    - Button alignment: left, center, right
    - Button width: auto, full-width on mobile
    
    Responsive Controls:
    - Desktop: multi-column grid with custom gap
    - Tablet: adjustable columns (default 2)
    - Mobile: single column stacked, full-width cards
    - Mobile-specific font size overrides
    - Mobile-specific spacing adjustments
    - Mobile button: option for full-width
    
    Technical Requirements:
    - Equal height cards in each row
    - Smooth transitions for hover effects and play/pause toggle
    - Accessible ARIA labels for play/pause buttons
    - Keyboard navigation support
    - Proper contrast ratios for text overlays
    - Lazy load YouTube iframe API
    - Prevent layout shift when video loads
    - Support for 1-12 video card blocks
    
    Visual Polish:
    - Smooth fade-in animation when thumbnail is replaced by video
    - Play button pulse or glow effect option
    - Card shadow on hover (optional)
    - Text overlay with gradient background for readability (optional)
    - Rounded corners on cards and buttons
    - Consistent spacing and alignment across all breakpoints, Create a responsive YouTube Shorts video gallery section optimized for vertical 9:16 aspect ratio thumbnails with lazy loading and interactive play controls.
    
